The Korean Workers' Party's architectural philosophy of putting the people first is clearly on display.
Dear Comrade Kim Jong-un said the following:.
《Juche's socialist architecture is, in essence, a people-first architecture..》
Juche Architecture, which is enjoying an unprecedented heyday in the government under the wise leadership of the Party, is showing off its grandeur to the world as a symbol of our feat of leaping forward into a powerful nation..
This is simply the speed and scale of construction, It is not only about advancedness and modernity..
The true meaning and true value of the great prosperity period of construction unfolded by the great Korean Workers' Party lies in the fact that each and every building rising on this land is a monumental creation that perfectly embodies the people-first principle..
Our party's architectural philosophy of putting the people first is clearly demonstrated in the fact that, above all else, the construction of residential houses, which are directly connected to the lives of the people, is promoted as the most important task of the party and government, and is realized at the highest level even under any unfavorable conditions and environments..
The dear Comrade General Secretary said that socialism must be built from the hearts of the people and that the housing issue is the issue that our people are most interested in. He placed residential housing construction at the core of the construction policy proposed by the 8th Congress of the Party and ensured that it be carried out unconditionally, regardless of conditions or circumstances. .
It was only when the fourth new house was in full swing in the Hwaseong district, which was being transformed into a single city administrative district, that the party finally opened., The people-friendly nature of our party's policies can be seen simply by the fact that a government agency building has been established., Learn about the people-first architectural philosophy..
It's not just the capital.
With the 8th Congress of the Workers' Party of Korea as an opportunity, socialist construction entered a period of comprehensive development, and the historic 4th Plenary Meeting of the 8th Central Committee of the Party presented grand goals and fighting tasks for the rapid development of our rural areas..
Our party regards the project of changing the aspect and environment of rural areas as the most important task in socialist rural construction., A people-oriented project desired and cheered by all the people., A new rural civilization of our time, He presented it as a political project that would unfold a new world in which the region would change, and energetically led the struggle to realize it..
The problem of developing local construction while taking advantage of the characteristics of each region., First, organize the standard groups and create a model to create a bee prevention zone., mountainous area, Socialist rural construction progressed steadily without any momentary stagnation due to the rural construction strategies suggested by the respected Comrade General Secretary during the days of revolutionary leadership that brought about great prosperity in construction, including the issue of setting a model for coastal areas and generalizing it..
Last year alone, more than 32,000 new modern homes with different structures and shapes were built across the country..
Indeed, solving the people's housing problem is a major strategic plan that our Party attaches utmost importance to and will definitely realize for the overall development of the country, and is a basic task in carrying out the construction revolution in the new era..
Our party's architectural philosophy of putting the people first is expressed in the fact that buildings for the people are springing up like mushrooms in every famous place in various parts of the country..
The reality of ordinary people becoming owners of the best and most prestigious places, fully enjoying the wealth of civilization, and enjoying supreme happiness is a deeply moving canvas that only our party, which perfectly embodies the people-first principle in construction, can unfold..
Pyongyang General Hospital, a monument to the love of the people, which arose in support of the passionate long-awaited wish of the Workers' Party of Korea, and the attic housing complex on the Pothong River, which was splendidly built as a paradise of happiness for the people enjoying the new socialist civilization., The Science and Technology Center, a pinnacle of architectural art, has been built on Ssuk Island, where the Daedong River flows, and large-scale vegetable production bases have sprung up all over the country., The Geumsanpo Salted Fish Processing Factory, built in the scenic Geumsanpo district, is a living product of Juche architecture that has sprung up in auspicious locations personally selected by the respected Comrade General Secretary..
This isn't the only thing.
Mirim Riding Club and Masikryeong Ski Resort, Okryu Children's Hospital, Ryukyung Dental Hospital, Kimchaek University of Technology Educator's Home, Pyongyang Daedonggang Seafood Restaurant, Pyongyang Orphanage and Children’s Home, Pyongyang Nursing Home, There are many monumental buildings that tell heart-warming stories behind famous places, such as the Wonsan Kalma Coastal Tourist District, which has emerged as one of the world's leading coastal tourist cities..
Our socialist fatherland is the only country where truly ordinary people become owners of the best and most prestigious places, and where the people's wealth is constantly growing in each of those places..
Our party's people-first architectural philosophy also emphasizes good convenience., This is demonstrated by the fact that convenience is guaranteed at the highest level in line with the people's ever-increasing ideological sentiments and needs, based on the principle of sternness and academic excellence..
Construction is the standard of creation that our party pursues for the people., Intuitively recognize the beautiful vision of the future and change people’s life rhythms and habits, It is a cultural revolution process that brings about positive changes in lifestyle..
Although it is difficult and difficult now, we must look far ahead and build a building with the highest level of civilization, which is the standard for architectural creation set forth by our dear Comrade General Secretary..
In construction, the people's aspirations and needs must be addressed., Our party's noble intention that convenience should be the top priority and that ideology, artistry, and practicality should be perfectly guaranteed in line with the people's emotions and aesthetics is unfolding the century-old dreams and ideals cherished by the people of this land into a brilliant reality..
Gyeongnu-dong’s attic housing complex, which has emerged as an example of modern attic housing complex, and its modernity and practicality, In terms of aesthetics, new streets in Hwaseong District and rural villages across the country are showing new and improved aspects every year., New local industrial factories and general service centers, poetry, Military hospitals are examples of the best civilization that our Party seeks to bring to the people, and they are powerfully leading our people toward a bright future..
The respected Comrade General Secretary said that prioritizing the people's convenience can be said to be the key in city construction, and he devoted great effort and effort to provide the best to the people..
All support is provided to the new streets of Hwaseong District, where the grand ideals of the Workers' Party of Korea are condensed., commercial, Convenience service facilities are placed within the residential area, the main roads and feeder roads are connected to ensure the convenience of residents, and an underground crossing is provided for the convenience of residents' daily lives., The meticulous leadership and passionate love of our dear Comrade General Secretary, who cared deeply for everyone from the top to the top, are indescribable..
Indeed, our country is the only country in the world that allows the ecstatic and wonderful downtown areas that arouse the admiration of the world to belong to ordinary people, and provides the working people with unique homes built at the cost of tens of thousands of dollars, free of charge..
Therefore, on this meaningful day when he attended the completion ceremony of the 10,000-unit residence hall in the 4th phase of the Hwaseong District, which concludes the monumental 5-year capital construction plan, the respected Comrade General Secretary passionately said that the reason why the newly built Hwaseong District is so beautiful is because, although it is a masterpiece of the great architects who embody advanced civilization, it is because the true happiness and bright appearance of the people are hidden within it..
Under the leadership of the Party, our architecture will continue to develop endlessly, taking the needs of the people as the absolute standard and leading the civilization of a new era in line with the principle of people-first architecture..
Headquarters Reporter Kim Seong-min
The people's ideals have risen as a result of the people-first politics.
